      "equipmentNotes": "Distance programmes run on the UVT online platform (training.uvt.tn); students need internet access and a computer (implied by mode, no explicit equipment list found).",
      "notes": "Created by decree n°2002-112 of 28 Jan 2002; became an EPST by later decree; missions set by decree n°430 of 6 May 2019; new organigramme decree n°226 of 7 Apr 2021 (UVT 'Missions et réalisations', 2022). Address: 13 Rue Ibn Nadim, 1073 Montplaisir, Tunis. ROLE FOR OTHER INSTITUTIONS: UVT runs the national Moodle-based ENT (https://ent.uvt.rnu.tn) installed on UVT servers, with a dedicated space per public university institution, managed by a CEL (UVT correspondent in each institution, or the university's DDEV) who creates course categories/spaces per study plan, secured with enrolment keys, and assigns teachers; part of the national project to generalise online teaching for all public universities (CEL roadmap PDF). Other faculties (e.g. Faculté de Médecine de Tunis) run their Moodle via UVT since 2018 (search result citing FMT charte graphique, medium confidence). UVT also runs annual webinars for ENT teacher-users (e.g. 3-6 Nov 2026). UVT degree exams are held in person at UVT exam centres. Courses use the Moodle-style path /my/courses.php on training.uvt.tn (software inferred). No official Facebook page found.",
